<title>THAILAND: Thai Airways six mth net profit lower.</title>
<headline>Thai Airways six mth net profit lower.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>		    (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				  1997			  1996</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		1.34	vs		1.76</p>
<p>    Net		   2,150.75	vs	  2,462.48</p>
<p>NOTE: Results are audited and consolidated. Second quarter figures not available. Company's full name is Thai Airways International Plc.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
